# Single source of truth for the trusted F1R3FLY-io/system-integration ref
# used by GitHub Actions OCI runner launch and integration-test workflows.
#
# Use a reviewed 40-character commit SHA. A SHA is immutable, so a repo
# takeover in system-integration cannot move what the secret-bearing launch
# jobs execute; tags can be re-pointed and are no longer used here by policy
# (the workflow still tolerates refs/tags/ for emergencies).
#
# Do not use mutable branch names. Update this value only after reviewing the
# corresponding system-integration change that supplies the OCI runner launcher
# and integration-test harness.
#
# MUST be kept identical to SYSTEM_INTEGRATION_REF in
# .github/workflows/_integration-pipeline.yml — a reusable workflow cannot
# source this file at env-resolution time, so the pin is duplicated there.
# Bump both in the same commit: `just repin-system-integration <sha>`
# (scripts/repin-system-integration.sh) rewrites every pin site together and
# runs the invariants checker.
SYSTEM_INTEGRATION_REF=218fcbe13d97067cd83c975e56d90a69d3e518d7
